---
/**
 * LeafCanvas — reserved full-viewport layer for a future leaf animation.
 * Intentionally empty: it never intercepts pointer events and ships no JavaScript.
 */
---
<div
  id="leaf-canvas"
  aria-hidden="true"
  class="pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 z-0 h-[100dvh] w-screen overflow-hidden"
></div>
